<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - HomeBase started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - HomeBase started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns initiated coverage of starts HomeBase Inc with a neutral rating, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- Effective Monday, Waban Inc spun off BJ's Wholesale Club Inc, and changed its name to HomeBase Inc.</p>
</text>
